# Over music the engine invents "Thanks for watching". It is dropped on its own, so the
# sentence after it survives, and the same words said confidently survive too.
S 0.0 1.5 logprob=-1.6 no-speech=0.92
W 0.0 0.5 Thanks
W 0.5 1.0 for
W 1.0 1.5 watching.
S 2.0 3.4 logprob=-0.2 no-speech=0.02
W 2.0 2.5 Okay
W 2.5 2.9 listen
W 2.9 3.4 up.
S 8.0 9.2 logprob=-0.18 no-speech=0.02
W 8.0 8.4 Thanks
W 8.4 8.8 for
W 8.8 9.2 watching,
W 9.2 9.6 everyone.
